<title>BELGIUM: Air freight traffic grows at Ostend (OST) Airport.</title>
<headline>Air freight traffic grows at Ostend (OST) Airport.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ostend Airport said it handled 7,689 tonnes of air cargo traffic in July -- an increase of 60.5 percent on the same month in 1995.</p>
<p>The major airfreight market from Ostend Airport is cigarette exports destined for the Commonwealth of Independent States.</p>
<p>In the first seven months of 1996, the Belgian airport handled  53,611 tonnes  of air cargo traffic, up 21.5  percent on the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>-Air Cargo Newsroom tel:+44 171 542 7706 fax:+44 171 542 5017</p>
